{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a high-score first-person shooter, where you play as a tree on a journey to save the forest from an evil wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the full release of this game, there are plans for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Online Coop with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Campaign to play solo or with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A hub-world with quests or options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Difficulty modifiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Infinite high-score mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-New shop items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-New enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-New weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Additional accessibility options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities and upgrades to fend off the onslaught of evil creatures sent by the wizard, and team up with friends in the full version to finally take him down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a cartoony low poly art-style.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4154060?t=1769468761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154060/174482ce18913d61549ed59e2fe94f888213d82b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769468761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154060/0d00555b78e5b3f2da0782fdf5bec50a1ca30470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769468761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154060/0d00555b78e5b3f2da0782fdf5bec50a1ca30470/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769468761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"F